<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>Kontak | Nama Perusahaan</title><script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script><script>tailwind.config={theme:{extend:{colors:{navy:'#0B2850',brand:'#1769AA',skysoft:'#EAF3FC'}}}}</script><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/style.css"></head>
<body class="font-site text-slate-700"><div id="header"></div><main><section class="page-hero"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-20"><p class="eyebrow text-blue-200">TERHUBUNG DENGAN KAMI</p><h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-extrabold text-white md:text-5xl">Kontak</h1><p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-blue-100">Kami siap mendengar kebutuhan, pertanyaan, maupun peluang kerja sama dari Anda.</p></div></section>
<section class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-12 px-6 py-20 lg:grid-cols-5"><div class="lg:col-span-2"><p class="eyebrow">INFORMASI KONTAK</p><h2 class="section-title">Mari Terhubung</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-600">Silakan hubungi kami melalui informasi berikut. Tim kami akan dengan senang hati membantu Anda.</p><div class="mt-8 space-y-6"><div class="contact-row"><span>✉</span><div><b>Email</b><p>info@namaperusahaan.co.id</p></div></div><div class="contact-row"><span>☎</span><div><b>Telepon / WhatsApp</b><p>+62 812-3456-7890</p></div></div><div class="contact-row"><span>⌖</span><div><b>Alamat</b><p>Jl. Nama Jalan No. 123, Kota, Indonesia</p></div></div><div class="contact-row"><span>◷</span><div><b>Jam Operasional</b><p>Senin–Jumat, 08.00–17.00 WIB</p></div></div></div></div>
<div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7 shadow-lg lg:col-span-3"><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-navy">Kirim Pesan</h2><p class="mt-2 text-slate-500">Lengkapi formulir berikut. Hubungkan formulir ke backend atau layanan formulir sebelum digunakan secara langsung.</p><form class="mt-7 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2" onsubmit="event.preventDefault();alert('Terima kasih. Formulir contoh ini belum terhubung ke server.');"><label class="form-label">Nama Lengkap<input required type="text" placeholder="Nama Anda" class="form-input"></label><label class="form-label">Email<input required type="email" placeholder="nama@email.com" class="form-input"></label><label class="form-label sm:col-span-2">Subjek<input type="text" placeholder="Topik pesan" class="form-input"></label><label class="form-label sm:col-span-2">Pesan<textarea required rows="5" placeholder="Tuliskan pesan Anda..." class="form-input"></textarea></label><div class="sm:col-span-2"><button class="btn-primary" type="submit">Kirim Pesan</button></div></form></div></section>
<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 pb-20"><div class="flex h-64 items-center justify-center rounded-3xl bg-skysoft text-center"><div><div class="text-4xl">📍</div><h2 class="mt-3 text-xl font-bold text-navy">Lokasi Perusahaan</h2><p class="mt-2 text-slate-600">Tambahkan embed Google Maps sesuai alamat perusahaan.</p></div></div></section></main><div id="footer"></div><script src="assets/site.js"></script></body></html>